          "settings": {
            "question": "Will I see the design before you make it?",
            "answer": "Yes. Once our team has developed your design, we’ll share it with you for approval before we begin crafting the actual piece. You can share your feedback on the proposed design before production begins, and our team will work with you to finalise it."
